                <pb facs="1071" n="977" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg977"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 to inclosure in No. 141.—Card of
                        introduction received October 30, 1886.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Williams</hi>: The bearer, Mr. Henry
                    Draper, who came highly recommended to me, is here without a passport. Can you
                    arrange anything to get him off without extra expense?</p>
                <p>Yours, truly,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gmo. Zaldo.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
